---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const canonical = 'https://colotopia.com/en/about/';
const altUrl = 'https://colotopia.com/fr/a-propos/';
---

<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="About Colotopia"
  description="Colotopia is an independent website dedicated to free printable coloring pages for kids and adults. Discover our story, mission and the team behind the project."
  canonical={canonical}
  altUrl={altUrl}
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <h1>About Colotopia</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      Colotopia is an independent website offering hundreds of free printable coloring pages,
      designed for both children and adults.
    </p>

    <h2>Our mission</h2>
    <p>
      We believe coloring is a universal activity: it soothes, sparks creativity and brings
      generations together. Our mission is to make the largest possible catalog of original coloring
      pages freely accessible, in high quality, and ready to print with one click.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every illustration published on Colotopia is designed specifically for our site. We do not
      redistribute images from elsewhere: all our pages are original and free to use for personal
      and educational purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>Who is it for?</h2>
    <p>
      Our catalog targets a wide audience. For younger children, we offer simple, cute and educational
      designs: animals, vehicles, seasons, jobs, dinosaurs. For teens and adults, we've developed a
      dedicated section with mandalas, mosaics, zodiacs, landscapes, cottagecore and stress relief
      pages — perfect for a relaxing moment or a regular artistic practice.
    </p>

    <h2>Why coloring?</h2>
    <p>
      Many studies have shown the benefits of coloring: it improves concentration, reduces stress,
      stimulates fine motor skills in children, and activates brain areas linked to creativity.
      It's also an excellent way to encourage learning: colors, shapes, animals, geography or music
      can all be approached through a simple coloring page.
    </p>

    <h2>Our editorial commitment</h2>
    <p>
      Colotopia is an independent editorial project. We're committed to offering quality content,
      with no mandatory sign-up, no forced downloads, and no advertising overload. A few Google
      AdSense ad slots are displayed on the site to help us keep creating new coloring pages and
      maintaining the platform.
    </p>

    <h2>The team</h2>
    <p>
      Colotopia is run by a small team passionate about design, illustration and parenting. The site
      was born from the desire to share a carefully curated, free coloring library usable by
      everyone — at home, at school or in workshops.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>
      Got a question, a suggestion, a partnership request or a report? We're listening:
      <a href="/en/contact/">contact us</a> or write to
      <a href="mailto:contact@colotopia.com">contact@colotopia.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .legal-page h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #1f2937;
  }
  .legal-page .lead {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .legal-page h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: #1f2937;
  }
  .legal-page p {
    color: #4b5563;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .legal-page a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
